      <activity id="4ecef63b-b8bc-5c68-bdc5-8ba8649efd39" activityNameId="f10e7cb4-b8b7-5b3f-b74e-518269d16564" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper, woodfree, coated, at integrated mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, woodfree, coated, at integrated mill
na;
UUID: a50b0327-4733-30fa-9ec1-4f3c3afd7b81
This module includes the European production of coated woodfree paper in an integrated paper mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, paper production, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database and from several European fine paper producers used as European average data.
Location:  Data from a finnish database and from several European fine paper producers used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European production in 2000: 9'746 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a50b0327-4733-30fa-9ec1-4f3c3afd7b81.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
